{"id":"S04-I1","variant":"AP","board":"AP","template":"T01","screen":"N.6","title":"A demand boom","currency":"","model":{"funcs":{"MC":["q","11-0.4*q+0.03*q^2"],"AVC":["q","11-0.2*q+0.01*q^2"],"AC":["q","360/q+11-0.2*q+0.01*q^2"],"g":["q","240*q-(D-300*(11-0.4*q+0.03*q^2))"],"g2":["q,p","11-0.4*q+0.03*q^2-p"]},"vars":[["qs","solve(g,10,90)"],["Psr","MC(qs)"],["ty","itype"],["nl","ty==0 ? (D-7800)/30 : (ty==1 ? (D-7080)/33 : (D-8520)/27)"],["Plr","ty==0 ? 26 : (ty==1 ? 26+(nl-240)/100 : 26-(nl-240)/100)"],["P","time==0 ? Psr : Plr"],["q","time==0 ? qs : 30"],["firms","time==0 ? 240 : nl"],["Qm","D-300*P"],["shiftAC","time==0 ? 0 : Plr-26"],["profit","(P-AC(q)-shiftAC)*q"]]},"controls":[{"id":"D","type":"range","label":"Demand (quantity demanded at a price of 0)","min":15000,"max":30000,"start":15000,"step":1500,"fmt":"{fmt(v,0)}"},{"id":"time","type":"toggle","label":"Time","off":"short run","on":"long run","start":0},{"id":"itype","type":"seg","label":"Industry type","options":[{"v":0,"l":"constant cost"},{"v":1,"l":"increasing cost"},{"v":2,"l":"decreasing cost"}],"start":0}],"panels":[{"type":"xy","x":{"label":"Market Q","min":0,"max":22000,"ticks":false},"y":{"label":"P","min":0,"max":60,"ticks":[0,20,40,60]},"els":[{"t":"fn","x":"15000-300*y","k":"grey","lab":"D1","dash":true,"if":"D!=15000"},{"t":"fn","x":"D-300*y","k":"d","lab":"{D==15000 ? \"D\" : \"D2\"}"},{"t":"fn","x":"240*solve(g2,10,90,y)","k":"s","lab":"S (240 firms)","from":10,"to":60,"n":40},{"t":"fn","x":"firms*solve(g2,10,90,y)","k":"s","lab":"S ({fmt(firms,0)} firms)","dash":true,"if":"time==1 && D!=15000","from":10,"to":60,"n":40},{"t":"hline","y":"Plr","k":"green","lab":"LRS","dash":"3 4","if":"time==1"},{"t":"drop","x":7200,"y":26,"xl":"","yl":"26","k":"grey","if":"abs(P-26)>0.5"},{"t":"drop","x":"Qm","y":"P","xl":"{fmt(Qm,0)}","yl":"{fmt(P,1)}"}],"h":250,"title":"Market"},{"type":"xy","x":{"label":"Firm q","min":0,"max":60,"ticks":[0,20,40,60]},"y":{"label":"P","min":0,"max":60,"ticks":[0,20,40,60]},"els":[{"t":"rect","x0":0,"y0":"P","x1":"q","y1":"AC(q)+shiftAC","k":"profit","if":"P>AC(q)+shiftAC+0.01"},{"t":"fn","y":"MC(x)+shiftAC","k":"s","lab":"MC","from":5,"to":60},{"t":"fn","y":"AC(x)+shiftAC","k":"purple","lab":"ATC","from":8,"to":60},{"t":"hline","y":"P","k":"d","lab":"P = MR = AR = D ({fmt(P,1)})"},{"t":"drop","x":"q","y":"P","xl":"q = {fmt(q,0)}","yl":false}],"h":250,"title":"One firm"}],"readouts":[{"l":"Price","v":"{fmt(P,1)}","k":"blue"},{"l":"Output per firm","v":"{fmt(q,1)}"},{"l":"Profit per firm","v":"{fmt(profit,0)} (economic)","k":"green"},{"l":"Number of firms","v":"{fmt(firms,0)}"},{"l":"Industry output","v":"{fmt(Qm,0)}"}],"predict":{"q":"240 identical firms each make normal profit at a price of 26. Assume each firm's costs do not change as the industry grows. Demand rises and stays higher. Where does the price end up in the long run?","options":[{"k":"A","s":"It stays at the new, higher short-run price","fb":"Economic profit of 600 per firm is a signal. With free entry new firms arrive, supply shifts right and the price falls."},{"k":"B","s":"It returns to 26","fb":"Entry continues until price is back at minimum ATC: 26. There are now 490 firms, each making 30."},{"k":"C","s":"It falls below 26, because more firms compete harder","fb":"Entry stops once economic profit is zero. Below minimum ATC, firms would make losses and leave, so the price cannot settle there (with constant costs)."}],"correct":"B"},"task":"Move the **Demand** slider right to 22,500, then switch **Time** from \"short run\" to \"long run\". Watch the price, the number of firms and each firm's profit. Then switch **Industry type** to \"increasing cost\" and \"decreasing cost\" and repeat.","target":{"expr":"D==22500 && time==1 && itype==0","do":"Set Demand to 22,500 and Time to \"long run\", then press Check."},"takeaway":"Entry continues until price is back at minimum ATC (26). More firms; same output each.","explore":"Short run at 22,500: price 43, output 40 per firm, profit 600. Increasing cost ends above 26; decreasing cost below 26.","alt":"A demand boom","test":{"set":{"D":22500,"time":1},"expect":["near(P,26)","near(q,30)","near(firms,490)","near(profit,0,0.01)"],"cases":[{"set":{"D":22500},"expect":["near(P,43,0.001)","near(q,40,0.001)","near(profit,600,0.01)","near(Qm,9600,0.1)"]},{"set":{},"expect":["near(P,26,0.001)","near(q,30,0.001)","near(Qm,7200,0.5)"]},{"set":{"D":22500,"time":1,"itype":1},"expect":["P>26"]},{"set":{"D":22500,"time":1,"itype":2},"expect":["P<26"]}],"spoilerOK":["shows 30"]}}